      "message": "Directed SSSP: open the issue route with the (D, T) record gate\n\n- CLOSED is empty: the smoke (run 41641134677, #127) passed and the control\n  and five statement mutations were refused (#128 to #133).\n- current_record reads the site board's Lean Verified point rows and the\n  chart lines of those rows (sssp_record); qualifies_for_run compares the\n  candidate at its own D (sssp_qualifies). verifier #134: the old code\n  called Fraction() on 'D ; T' and stopped the selection pass.\n- Lead decisions G1 and G2 (2026-11-03): parse_sssp refuses T >= n·D (clause\n  2 of Bound gives it for free); below n log^3/4 n, Vals AI's Lean Verified\n  line Tchd gates. Claimed rows, the paper rows and the classic never gate.\n- tests/fixtures/sssp-cases.json is a byte copy of the site's shared cases\n  (site 485ab6ff), checked by SharedCaseTests.\n- The issue form lists directed-sssp; docs/targets.md and the statement\n  README state the gate, the free bound and the classic board line.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
